WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
The Philippines is an archipelago of over 7,640 islands in the western Pacific Ocean.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Mount Apo in Mindanao rises to 2,954 meters as the nation's highest volcanic peak.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Filipino and English are official national languages, alongside over 120 regional tongues.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
The formal Barong Tagalog shirt is intricately embroidered from sheer pineapple Piña fibers.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Heritage music features the Kulintang gong row ensemble and bamboo Tinikling folk dance.

